    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-documentation/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Documentation Theme is a robust and user-friendly tool tailored for businesses, developers, SaaS companies, product owners, and ecommerce brands seeking to build professional help centers, knowledge bases, product guides, API documentation, and support portals. It also integrates ecommerce functionality, allowing the sale of digital products, premium guides, online courses, and training materials through WooCommerce, making it particularly well-suited for dropshipping shops and POD stores. With a clean, intuitive, and fast-loading design optimized for desktops, tablets, and smartphones, the theme features advanced search capabilities, categorized content, interactive navigation, code highlighting for developers, and bbPress compatibility for community forums to facilitate engagement and troubleshooting discussions. Additionally, Contact Form 7 provides a quick way for support inquiries, while Yoast SEO enhances search visibility, improving user experience and trust. This lightweight and flexible theme allows for brand customization, structured onboarding, tutorials, FAQs, and effective product knowledge presentation. Overall, the Online Documentation Theme serves as a conversion-focused, professional platform that boosts customer satisfaction, streamlines support, and creates opportunities for additional revenue through its integrated online store capabilities. For more details, visit the demo: https://www.vwthemes.net/online-documentation-pro/."
    },
